      "label": "joyful celebration emotion",
      "description": "The group of white men in the top panel are smiling broadly and raising glasses in a toast, conveying a sense of camaraderie, excitement, and revelry typical of a night out drinking. Their expressions and body language reflect uninhibited joy and social bonding.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
