      "description": "The text 'me the night before' is mapped onto the visual entity 'group_of_men' in the top panel, which depicts a group of white men toasting in a bar. This mapping identifies the group of men as representing the speaker ('me') during the night before heavy drinking.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
